@host = http://localhost:5000

### API health (also probes the Python OCR service)
GET {{host}}/health

### OCR service health (direct)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/health

### Analyze a vergi levhası
# Paths are relative to this file. Adjust to point at your own document.
POST {{host}}/api/vergi-levhasi/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_levha.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../tests/samples/sample_levha.pdf
--boundary--

### Reject a non-certificate document -> 422 NOT_TAX_CERTIFICATE
POST {{host}}/api/vergi-levhasi/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="not_a_levha.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../tests/samples/not_a_levha.png
--boundary--
